%N A038214 Triangle whose (i,j)-th entry is binomial(i,j)*2^(i-j)*8^j.
%H A038214 B. N. Cyvin, J. Brunvoll, and S. J. Cyvin, <a href="https://match.pmf.kg.ac.rs/electronic_versions/Match34/match34_109-121.pdf">Isomer enumeration of unbranched catacondensed polygonal systems with pentagons and heptagons</a>, Match, No. 34 (Oct 1996), 109-121.
%F A038214 T(n,k) = 8*T(n-1,k-1) + 2*T(n-1,k) with T(0,0)=1, T(n,k)=0 for k<0 or k>n. - _Ranjan Kumar Dhani_, Oct 05 2026
%e A038214 The triangle begins as:
%e A038214    1;
%e A038214    2,   8;
%e A038214    4,  32,   64;
%e A038214    8,  96,  384,   512;
%e A038214   16, 256, 1536,  4096,  4096;
%e A038214   32, 640, 5120, 20480, 40960, 32768;
%e A038214   ...
%t A038214 Flatten[Table[Binomial[i, j]2^(i-j) 8^j, {i, 0, 8}, {j, 0, i}]] (* _Ranjan Kumar Dhani_, Oct 05 2026 *)
